Package: sqlDT
Title: Display rates from the numerator and denominator in linked data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Li", email = "temp@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A `sqlDT` displays a single statistic derived from a linked
  table, where the numerator and denominator columns are specific. This is best
  used with the `crosstalk`package, to allow dynamic filtering of the underlying
  data.
URL: https://github.com/pli9/sqlDT, https://pli9.github.io/sqlDT/
BugReports: https://github.com/pli9/sqlDT/issues
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
